  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AMPLIFY CHANGE Core Contribution 2023-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agreement title: Ensuring healthy lives: Local organisations&#x2019; leadership on CSE and SRHR. Amplify Change is multi-donor fund supporting grassroot civil society organisations advocating for improved SRHR on different levels. The subgrants span the spectrum of SRHR such as CSE, abortion and access to reproductive health care, including family planning. AmplifyChange has a strong focus on women and youth in all their diversities, with a priority to marginalized and vulnerable groups including people living with disabilities, with HIV/AIDS, and in conflict-affected areas.</narrative>
  </description>
